    Bug 2044389 - Switching to EWS/Graph in manual config always hides OAuth. r=mkmelin


    **How to Test**
    - Ensure experimental.mail.ews.overrideOAuth.enabled is true (it should be by default these days)
    - Go to manual email account config in account hub
    - Switch from IMAP to EWS or Graph

    Expected result: OAuth should be available as an auth method,.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D305261

